# Auth is optional-one-of (checked in this order; see contracts/cli-contracts.md):
#   1. ANTHROPIC_API_KEY   — funded API key
#   2. CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN — from `claude setup-token` on a subscribed machine
#   3. (nothing) — a stored Claude Code login (`claude` -> /login) is used automatically
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN=
